Kumbhakarṇa laughs hearing lament of Rāvaṇa --- Kumbhakarṇa blames unconsidered act done from pride --- Kumbhakarṇa teaches place time counsel and duty wealth desire --- Kumbhakarṇa warns hasty witless ministers ruin master like foes --- Rāvaṇa frowns and rebukes Kumbhakarṇa as overbearing teacher --- Rāvaṇa demands present remedy and atonement by valor --- Kumbhakarṇa soothes brother and vows to kill foes in battle --- Kumbhakarṇa promises head of Rāma and grieving Sītā and routed monkeys --- Kumbhakarṇa defies Indra Yama gods vows to slay Lakṣmaṇa Sugrīva devour monkey chiefs